{"id":"52be70588beee387","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-smullyan-exponent-elimination.md","title":"Arithmetic and Arithmetic Relations Coincide Extensionally","display":"thm-smullyan-exponent-elimination — Arithmetic and Arithmetic Relations Coincide Extensionally","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-smullyan-exponent-elimination","aliases":["92-thm-smullyan-exponent-elimination"],"display":"thm-smullyan-exponent-elimination — Arithmetic and Arithmetic Relations Coincide Extensionally","source":"第 II 章 p. 19；第 IV 章 pp. 40–49（PDF 36、57–66）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-truth]]","[[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-smullyan-exponent-elimination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-smullyan-exponent-elimination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-smullyan-exponent-elimination — Arithmetic and Arithmetic Relations Coincide Extensionally"},{"key":"source","html":"第 II 章 p. 19；第 IV 章 pp. 40–49（PDF 36、57–66）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6511106aac2e96b7\" href=\"?note=6511106aac2e96b7\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-truth\">92-df-smullyan-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"75a1feabdeb282fb\" href=\"?note=75a1feabdeb282fb\" title=\"92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1\">92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\">\\(R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Arith}_E^k\">\\(\\operatorname{Arith}_E^k\\)</span> 使用含指数语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Arith}_A^k\">\\(\\operatorname{Arith}_A^k\\)</span> 使用无指数语言。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}exponent\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall k\\geq1\\;\\forall R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\;\n[\\operatorname{Arith}_E^k(R)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Arith}_A^k(R)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}exponent\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall k\\geq1\\;\\forall R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\;\n[\\operatorname{Arith}_E^k(R)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Arith}_A^k(R)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>一向由无指数语言是含指数语言的子语言。另一向用 ExpRel 的无指数公式代替每个指数项：为该项的输入、输出引入新变量，以其函数图约束输出，再连接原原子式。指数在标准自然数上总且单值，所以在否定和量词下也可按公式结构有效消去；所有新变量须先换到未使用的名字。</p>\n<p>这里只给标准模型下的表达性等同，不把两个公式视为同一字符串，不据此声称 P.E./P.A. 是同一公理集或已实现字符级证明翻译，也不凭此得到 P.A. 的保守性结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-truth","status":"resolved","id":"6511106aac2e96b7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1","status":"resolved","id":"75a1feabdeb282fb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Arith}_E^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Arith}_A^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}exponent\\text{-}elimination}\\vdash\\quad\n\\forall k\\geq1\\;\\forall R\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\;\n[\\operatorname{Arith}_E^k(R)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Arith}_A^k(R)].","display":true}],"bytes":1554,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-40","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-beta-function]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-beta-coding]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-sigma1]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-sigma-collapse]] → [[92-cor-smullyan-diagonal-closure]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-elimination]]、[[92-thm-smullyan-syntax-arithmetization]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-pa-semantic-incompleteness]]。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-309","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-smullyan-exponent-elimination]]"}],"outgoing":["6511106aac2e96b7","75a1feabdeb282fb"]}